# Q (west of R's landing cell) beats A (south of it): R's landing updates its neighbours W,E,D,U,N,S
# and Q's push, blocked until then by the moving R, is queued first. At t4 Q takes R away and A's
# event is dropped: A never moves, X stays. Turned 90 degrees, A wins (landing-race-turned.drive).
design designs/gadgets/landing-race.txt
probe Q 0 2 0
probe A 1 2 1
probe X 1 1 1
probe Xlow 1 0 1
quiet 50
use -1 1 0
expect_trace Q ~~rEEE
expect A r
expect X #
expect Xlow .
quiet 4
expect_trace A rrrr
expect X #
